OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Flargely clear night for most, once any
OL,7,Fdaytime cloud fades or isolated
OL,8,Fcoastal showers ease. Turning rather
OL,9,Fcold beneath the cloud-free skies,
OL,10,Fwith a patchy frost likely.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA cold, crisp start,
OL,13,Ffollowed by a bright and largely sunny
OL,14,Fday. The odd shower is possible along
OL,15,Fthe Lincolnshire coast, but these
OL,16,Fmostly staying offshore. Cold and
OL,17,Fbreezy overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
